## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design a beginner OTCA path with privacy by design, geohash-based location masking, and per-tenant residency.

## Key Concepts

- Ingest-time privacy and per-tenant opt-in

- Geohash granularity and redaction strategy

- Regional topics and date-partitioned Parquet

- End-to-end testing for privacy, QoS, and data freshness

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudocode for ingest
function ingest(event) {
  // redact precise coords, derive geohash4
  const hash = geohash.encode(event.lat, event.lon, 4);
  const out = {
    tenant_id: event.tenant_id,
    event_type: event.event_type,
    timestamp: event.timestamp,
    geohash4: hash,
    session_id: event.session_id
  };
  publish(out);
}
```

